        <div class="crp-contact-info wl-ko">한국생명의말씀협회 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>TEL</strong> 031-611-9216 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>EMAIL</strong> wolkorea1@gmail.com</div>
        <div class="crp-contact-info wl-en">Word of Life Korea &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>TEL</strong> 031-611-9216 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>EMAIL</strong> wolkorea1@gmail.com</div>
      </div>
